join Petrus (Neutral) left
join Hope (Neutral) right
update Petrus (Worried)
join Lebo (Neutral) left
Lebo: Petrus, where has this BEEN?
Petrus: In my yard. Where you've walked past it about nine hundred times.
- Could have just asked for the hinges
	Hope: You could have just asked them for the hinges.
	Petrus: Could have.
	Petrus: Then I'd have been an old man being given things.
	Petrus: This way I'm a man who had something they wanted.
[signal arg="hearts:petrus:1"]
set {GameState.petrus_traded_mangle} = true
